&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-778977-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Researchers familiar with paramedia should note the contrast with nonexistent works of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2747&quot;&gt;anafabulaic&lt;/a&gt; origin, which are generally described with consistent details.&lt;/div&gt;
