&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Comic Sans MS;&quot;&gt;dado articles tend to veer towards comedy, but they can also serve as excellent vehicles for &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4949&quot;&gt;horror&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3802&quot;&gt;cute moments&lt;/a&gt;, and many other such things. Much like dado, try to experiment!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
