&lt;p&gt;She isn&#039;t doing the talking. It&#039;s like her body is doing it for her while she is floating out into a gray thoughts. &amp;quot;I was&amp;#8230; Lying. About the trilobites.&amp;quot; She isn&#039;t bothered by it. It&#039;s fine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
